Z||000000||moonie||01-25-2001||10:13 AM||||i just went a saw the website of Elenor84.<BR>he says his car is a 1984 Pontiac Fiero 2M4. <BR>i think i have a 85SE but my car looks<BR>EXACTLY like his.  i don't mean close.....i mean exactly. the only difference i see is his has 4 sp & mine is automatic. also on my sail panel plexiglass there was a SE sticker on the inside. (repairing sail panel) <P>can someone please tell me the difference between a 84 2M4 & a 85 SE ????<P>i looked on my title & it says <BR>Model No.<BR>F37<P>if this helps <BR><p>[This message has been edited by moonie (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||01-25-2001||10:21 AM||||The '84 SE sail panels are glass and in '85 they went to plastic.<P>I think were some cosmetic improvements in wiring and a few other things over the '84's.  The '85 SE could be ordered with the 2.8 V6.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||01-25-2001||10:30 AM||||84 SE ~ Glass Sailpanels (only year for glass) Different wiring harness layout. Only 4-cyl available (in 84 there were no V-6's)<P>85 SE ~ V-6 optional, Metallic Grey color added, Plastic sailpanels, Same body style as base coupes (84 base, 84 SE, 85 base, 85 SE)<BR>The only difference in the body panels was in 84 the rear decklid has 2 solid end covers and a magnesium grate as part of the decklid. In 85 the decklid was changed to a solid with a "hump" and the end covers were changed to vented.||||reg||1
Z||000003||moonie||01-25-2001||10:46 AM||||thanks <P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Standard||01-25-2001||01:08 PM||||Actually, 85 and up Fiero's had almost a completely different wiring harness than the 84's.  85's also had some slight improvements to the suspension, the voltmeter in the tach was replaced by an oil pressure gauge (the voltmeter moved to the optional aux. gauge pod) and had a 5 speed isuzu manual tranny instead of the 4 speed muncie.  I think that's about it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Everybody wants a normal life and a cool car.. <B>Most people settle for the car</B><P>I'm not dumb.  I just have a command of thoroughly useless information        <BR>AOL: LastMinuteBastrd<BR>AIM: Standard88||||reg||1
